<title>FINLAND: Raisio 1996 profit up 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Raisio 1996 profit up 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     166 vs 141</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   6.13 vs 6.26</p>
<p> Net sales					  3,928 vs 3,224</p>
<p> Operating profit				   196 vs 183</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish foodstuffs, animal feed and chemicals group Raision Tehtaat Oy had been for a 148 million markka profit before extras and tax (mean 152 million, range 128-204 million). The results were preliminary and Raisio has not yet made a dividend proposal, an official said.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	 420 vs 383</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 charge 4 vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		162 vs 140</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    54.0 vs 52.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Raision Tehtaat Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
